@startuml
title Figura 5 - Despliegue Productivo Multi-Región

actor "Usuario\nInternet" as User
participant "Cloudflare\nCDN + WAF + DNS" as CF
participant "Load Balancer\nHAProxy / AWS ALB" as LB

== REGIÓN PRIMARIA (Active) ==
participant "API Pods x3\nFlask + Gunicorn + Eventlet\nPort 8000" as API1
participant "Socket.IO Pods x3\nEventlet Workers\nPort 8001" as WS1
participant "Celery Workers x4\nBeat + Workers" as CELERY1
database "PostgreSQL Primary\nPatroni Leader\nPort 5432" as PG1
database "Redis Sentinel\nMaster + 2 Replicas\nPort 6379" as REDIS1
participant "MinIO Cluster\n4 Nodos Distribuidos\nPort 9000" as MINIO1
participant "Nginx + Certbot\nPWA Static + Proxy\nPort 80/443" as NGINX1

== REGIÓN SECUNDARIA (Standby) ==
participant "API Pods x2\nFlask + Gunicorn + Eventlet" as API2
participant "Socket.IO Pods x2\nEventlet Workers" as WS2
participant "Celery Workers x2\nBeat + Workers" as CELERY2
database "PostgreSQL Replica\nPatroni Follower\nAsync Replication" as PG2
database "Redis Sentinel\nReplicas Read-Only" as REDIS2
participant "MinIO Cluster\n4 Nodos Distribuidos" as MINIO2
participant "Nginx + Certbot\nPWA Static + Proxy" as NGINX2

== CONTROL PLANE GLOBAL ==
participant "Feature Flags\nfeature_flags table\nHot reload" as FLAGS
participant "Service Discovery\nConsul / etcd\nHealth endpoints" as SD
participant "Monitoring\nPrometheus + Grafana\nAlertmanager" as MON
participant "Log Aggregation\nELK / Loki\nAudit logs" as LOGS
participant "Backup/DR\nVelero + pgBackRest\nRPO < 1h" as BACKUP

User -> CF: HTTPS Request
CF -> LB: Proxy + WAF
LB -> API1: Ruta activa (health check OK)
LB -x API2: Standby (solo sync)

API1 --> FLAGS: Métricas + Health + Logs
API2 --> FLAGS: Replication lag + Status
FLAGS --> API1: Config flags + Deploy
FLAGS --> API2: Config flags + Promote

PG1 --> PG2: Replicación async\nPatroni (RPO=0)
REDIS1 --> REDIS2: Sentinel replication\nPub/Sub sync
MINIO1 --> MINIO2: Cross-region replication\nAsync + versioning

note right of LB
  HEALTH CHECKS:
  • /health → API pods
  • /ws/health → Socket.IO pods
  • Patroni: /master → PG leader
  • Sentinel: master check → Redis
  Failover < 30s automático
end note

note right of PG1
  PATRONI HA:
  • Leader election (etcd/Consul)
  • Sync replication (RPO=0)
  • Auto-failover < 30s
  • pgBackRest: full + incremental
  • Point-in-time recovery
end note

note right of REDIS1
  REDIS SENTINEL:
  • 3 Sentinels + Master + 2 Replicas
  • Auto-failover master
  • Pub/Sub para Socket.IO adapter
  • Celery broker HA
end note

note right of MINIO1
  MINIO DISTRIBUIDO:
  • 4 nodos por región (erasure coding)
  • Replicación cross-region async
  • Versioning + Object locking
  • Gateway S3 compatible
end note

note right of FLAGS
  CONTROL PLANE:
  • Feature flags: activación caliente
  • Service discovery: registro automático
  • Monitoring: 4 golden signals
  • Audit logs: inmutables (RNF-AUD)
  • Backup/DR: RPO<1h, RTO<4h
end note

@enduml